{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1060485/block/singleImage/3249541/wm/01M5XQ236DAZBJ33BY45FF0989.jpg?updatedAt=1793082860\"/><figcaption>消息指，多份本地報章將於11月起加價3元(am730攝)</figcaption></figure><p>消息指，多份本地報章將於11月起加價3元，其中《明報》將於11月1日周日開始由而現時每份賣$12，加價到$15一份。至於周日不出版的《香港經濟日報》及《信報》會於11月2日周一加價，其中《香港經濟日報》每份會由$12加到$15，《信報》每份就會由$15加到$18。 對上一次中文報章加價是於2024年11月。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T06:42:40.335066+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":183,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T03:40:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T20:18:28.980633+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:38:37.542009+00:00","content_hash":"f60573516d1b4ee9912b5afb68ffe1c1817746712f4cedd51b827130ff61504e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T06:42:40.335066+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}